title: AWS CloudFront Distribution
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS CloudFront distribution metrics via CloudWatch.
 Note: CloudFront metrics are only available in the us-east-1 region.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Requests: Total number of requests

 - Bytes Downloaded/Uploaded: Data transfer volume

 - Error Rates: Total, 4xx, and 5xx error rates as percentages

 - Cache Hit Rate: Percentage of requests served from cache

 - Origin Latency: Average latency to origin server in milliseconds

 Thresholds can be configured for error rates, cache hit rate (lower bound),
 and origin latency.

discovery:
 One service is created for each CloudFront distribution discovered.
